{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1012026-how-well-do-dogs-of-war-innocents-tales-of-the-13th-precinct-fit","id":1012026,"title":"How well do Dogs of War, Innocents, Tales of the 13th precinct fit?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-12-04T08:48:08-08:00","id":1012026,"title":"How well do Dogs of War, Innocents, Tales of the 13th precinct fit?","content":"an obvious question I think is how well do these older books work with 2nd edition, a lot of the example chars are still valid I know... but Im still nervous. how well the mechanics and such will work any problems that need addressing?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-04T11:07:24-08:00","id":1012074,"title":"","content":"Dogs of War: Mostly fits. Some supernatural stuff is slightly outdated, as supernaturals are more powerful and sometimes better behaved; a 2E Werewolf is made with the discovery that wolves don't have a natural alpha instinct, so now they're ideal soldiers as well as warriors, especially when it comes to special ops, recon, and assassination (The Wolf Must Hunt, and it's <i>good </i>at it), and 2E changelings are much better at soldering than 1E, due to the way Clarity works (Trauma may actually make the Lost saner), and are ideal when it comes to emergency logistics (the Hedge isn't reliable of safe, but only one shipment needs to get through or one team mostly intact to relieve the pressure) and intel (even beyond oneiromancy, a high-Clarity changeling is a natural oracle who can describe exactly what the commander officer thinks like and many details of their plans by looking at them very intensely). More recent supernaturals fit as well; Sin-Eaters can and do have a source of ready and nearly-undestroyable spies that crop up everywhere in a warzone, and the Underworld, Avernian Gates permitting, is a far more reliable and safe supply chain than the Hedge. Demons (who admit to their abilities) are a veritable armory of secret weapons in the form of Gadgets, and they infiltrate as easily as they breathe. Beasts are the only esohuman not inherently good at espionage, but they more than make up for it as a field commander, psyops agent, and the best of both worlds when it comes to logistics (and really, more than enough Integrity is lost naturally in the battlefield that the Lair is best described as &quot;wherever the Begotten officer wants it&quot;).<br /> <br /> Innocents: Applies mostly-to-entirely. Maybe some sidebars need to be added to represent other esohumans as they interact with children, but not much else (and that's probably a good place to examine at which point the Dark Mother's teachings cross the line into emotional abuse, and how noble Beasts stay on the line).<br /> <br /> 13th Precinct: Can largely be ported as is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}